OL,3,GNEWSABurnham calls summit of Welsh,
OL,4,AScottish and Northern Irish first
OL,5,Aministers
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham says he will bring
OL,8,Ftogether the leaders of Wales, Scotland
OL,9,Fand Northern Ireland this autumn for a
OL,10,Fsummit to help boost the UK economy.
OL,12,FHe made the announcement on a visit to
OL,13,FTata steelworks in Port Talbot - his
OL,14,Ffirst official visit to Wales as prime
OL,15,Fminister - where he met workers,
OL,16,Fapprentices and senior executives.
OL,18,FHe also suggested Wales and Scotland
OL,19,Fshould consider ways to deepen
OL,20,Fdevolution by following England's model
OL,21,Fwhere more powers are given to cities
OL,22,Fand regions under mayors.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
